t the handler is never called, regardless of what the user types."],[3654,"**Symptom:** Binding a `computed<T>()` signal directly to a PO-UI `@Input()` causes the\ncomponent to render `[object Object]` or crash with `Cannot read properties of undefined`."],[3576,"**Symptom:** Buttons placed in the same flex row as `po-input` fields appear 8px lower\nthan the visible input field edge, even with `align-items: flex-end` on the container."],[3596,"**Symptom:** Campos `type: 'currency'` ou `type: 'number'` em `po-dynamic-form` renderizam o input\ncom texto alinhado à **esquerda** — comportamento oposto ao padrão ERP / Protheus."],[3659,"**Symptom:** In a `master-detail` component using `po-table` with a `type: 'detail'` column,\nclicking to expand a row shows nothing. The detail rows are in the DOM but have zero height\nor remain invisible. The content appears only after the user clicks elsewhere or triggers\nany zone event."],[3630,"**Symptom:** Navigating via menu click renders the page shell (title, breadcrumb, action\nbuttons) but ALL projected content is invisible — fields, table, filters. Clicking anywhere\ninside the page makes everything appear instantly."],[3749,"**Symptom:** No TypeScript error but the selection never fires / rows never accumulate."],[3755,"**Symptom:** Quando `(p-selected)` dispara e você quer rejeitar a seleção, definir `$selected: false`\nde forma síncrona não tem efeito. A linha permanece visualmente selecionada."],[3767,"**Symptom:** Valores numéricos aparecem alinhados à esquerda, sem formatação de milhar ou decimais."],[3719,"**Symptom:** When two `po-table` components are placed side by side (flex:1 each),\neach table generates a horizontal scrollbar even though the specified `p-width` values\nseem reasonable."],[2073,"**Tabelas**"],[899,"**Tabelas** — `po-table`, `PoTableColumn`, `PoTableAction`, templates de célula/coluna/linha"],[327,"**Tela em branco ao navegar pelo menu (OnPush + po-page-\\*)** — Todos os 12 templates de componente